<!-- Headline: Title Case, No Chip -->
<h1 class="h1-mobile" data-slot="text" style="margin: 0 0 14px 0; font-family: 'Futura PT', Futura, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 800; color: #00243C; letter-spacing: 0.02em;">
                      Preseason Is Here
                    </h1>
<p data-slot="text" style="margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-family: 'Futura PT', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #141718;">
                      Fog Family,
                    </p>
<p data-slot="text" style="margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-family: 'Futura PT', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #141718;">
                      What an extraordinary start to our fall rugby calendar. Sunday's position calling ceremony was a moving tribute to the strength, dedication, and camaraderie that define San Francisco Fog RFC. Watching our 2026 Pathways rookies step forward and claim their positions was an unforgettable moment for the entire club.
                    </p>
<p data-slot="text" style="margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-family: 'Futura PT', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #141718;">
                      I want to extend my heartfelt thanks to <strong>Alvin</strong> and every Pathways lead and coach who poured countless hours of patience, skill-building, and heart into this cohort over the last month. Our club grows stronger because of your selfless leadership.
                    </p>
<p data-slot="text" style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-family: 'Futura PT', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #141718;">
                      Tonight, we officially kick off preseason training at Crocker Amazon (7:45–10:00 PM), followed by drinks at <strong>Pilsner Inn</strong>. Whether you're a ten-year veteran or a fresh Pathways graduate, bring your boots, your mouthguard, and your heart. Let's build something special together this season.
                    </p>
